claim.claim-text:
determining (152), utilizing a first sensor (17) on the unmanned aircraft (18), a first distance (41, 43) between the unmanned aircraft and a roof of a structure (21);
orientating (154) a camera (19) on the unmanned aircraft to capture a field of view of the roof at a desired angle (53) in relation to the roof, based on a known pitch (49) of the roof; and
determining (156) an image-capture distance (47) from the roof along a line of sight to the camera at the desired angle, based at least on the first distance and the pitch.

displaying the determined image-capture distance to an operator of the unmanned aircraft;
receiving, by the unmanned aircraft, a command with instructions to move the unmanned aircraft into a predetermined range (51) of image-capture distances (47) from the roof of the structure (21);
navigating the unmanned aircraft into the predetermined range; and
capturing, with the camera on the unmanned aircraft, one or more images (62) of the roof of the structure from the predetermined range of image-capture distances.

determining, with one or more computer processor (23, 24, 27), that the determined image-capture distance (47) is outside of a predetermined range (51) of image-capture distances (47) from the roof of the structure (21);
moving the unmanned aircraft (18) into the predetermined range of image-capture distances; and
capturing, with a camera (19) on the unmanned aircraft, one or more images (62) of the roof of the structure from the predetermined range of image-capture distances.
